// Grounded Brain: RAG chat request
// Eraser "Sequence Diagram" diagram-as-code. Paste into a new Sequence diagram at https://app.eraser.io
title Chat: POST /api/workspaces/:workspaceId/chat
autoNumber on

Client [icon: monitor, color: gray] > ChatService [icon: nodejs, color: green]: POST /chat {conversationId?, messages, model?, webSearch?}
activate ChatService
ChatService > Postgres [icon: postgres, color: blue]: verify workspace ownership
ChatService > Postgres: get or create conversation, save USER message
ChatService > Postgres: load last 12 messages (history from DB, not client)
ChatService > OpenAI [icon: openai, color: orange]: rewrite follow-up into standalone query (last 6 turns)
OpenAI --> ChatService: standalone query

par [label: retrieval and memories in parallel] {
  ChatService > OpenAI: embed query (text-embedding-3-small)
  ChatService > Pinecone [icon: database, color: blue]: top 6 chunks in workspace namespace (score >= 0.35)
  Pinecone --> ChatService: chunks + metadata
  ChatService > Mem0 [icon: brain, color: purple]: search user memories (top 5, score >= 0.3)
  Mem0 --> ChatService: memories
}

ChatService > ChatService: system prompt (rules + memories + rolling summary), user prompt (<sources> + question)
ChatService > OpenAI: streamText (optional web_search tool, max 3 steps)

opt [label: model calls web_search] {
  OpenAI --> ChatService: tool call {query}
  ChatService > Tavily [icon: search, color: orange]: search (5 results)
  Tavily --> ChatService: results
  ChatService > OpenAI: results labelled [W1], [W2]...
}

OpenAI --> Client: tokens streamed (UI message stream, X-Conversation-Id header)

ChatService > Postgres: onFinish: save ASSISTANT message + cited sources only
ChatService > Postgres: touch conversation, set title if missing

opt [label: 8+ messages since last summary] {
  ChatService > Inngest [icon: zap, color: purple]: send conversation/summarize
}
deactivate ChatService

ChatService --> Langfuse [icon: activity]: traces (userId, sessionId = conversationId)
